== Effects ==
* Spawns a [[familiar]] that follows Isaac's movement with a 3-second delay and deals 2 contact damage to enemies per tick (30 damage per second).
** {{dlc|r}} The fly follows Isaac on a 0.66 second delay instead.
* {{transformation contribution|Beelzebub}}

== Notes ==
* If other familiars that move with a similar pattern such as {{i|Multidimensional Baby}} have been collected before the Obsessed Fan, it will follow them instead with further delay.

